      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vuela tan rápido como un avión a reacción.\nEmbiste a bandadas de Pokémon pájaro y, si\natrapa a alguno, se lo traga de un bocado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can fly at speeds rivaling jet planes.\nIt dives into flocks of bird Pokémon and\ngulps the entire flock down whole.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las dos protuberancias que tiene en la cabeza\nle sirven de sensores. Puede rastrear presas\nque se encuentren a gran distancia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The protuberances on its head serve as\nsensors. It can even detect distant prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surca el aire a velocidad supersónica en busca\nde presas y no duda en librar una batalla aérea\ncon un Salamence para quedarse con ellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It flies at the speed of sound while searching\nfor prey, and it has midair battles with\nSalamence as the two compete for food.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus escamas, pequeñas, lisas y afiladas, no solo\nlo hacen más aerodinámico, sino que le sirven\npara herir al rival que ose atacarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its fine scales don’t just reduce wind\nresistance—their sharp edges also cause injury\nto any opponent who attacks it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en montañas de origen volcánico. Vuela\ntan rápido como un avión a reacción en busca de\npresas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Garchomp makes its home in volcanic mountains.\nIt flies through the sky as fast as a jet airplane,\nhunting down as much prey as it can.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se mueve a gran velocidad incluso por tierra. Es\ncapaz de cazar una presa en una montaña nevada\ny volver a su guarida sin llegar a pasar frío.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Garchomp is fast both underground and above.\nIt can bring down prey and return to its den\nbefore its body has chilled from being outside.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight!\nIt has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one\nmeets a Garchomp out in the wilds.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
